[
  {"comment": "SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT. The design of the hidden holes' centre marks test (mitcad#1286, drawing-hidden-holes-test.cmake): a 19 x 19 x 180 bar along Z (F2.b0) with M5 tapped holes through it from two adjacent sides, each a linear pattern along the bar: six at z 10, 42, ... 170 from one side (Hole F3, its pattern F4) and five at z 26, 58, ... 154 from the other (Hole F5, its pattern F6), so that each side view sees one row end on and the other across, hidden inside the bar. The points lie on the bar's middle line; a face placement puts them onto the face. A drawing D1 on A3 at 1:2: the front view (from -Y), the right view beside it and the top view (the bar's end) above it."},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F1", "corner": [0, 0], "width": 19, "height": 19},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude",
    "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
    "extent": {"type": "distance", "distance": 180}, "operation": "new_body"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "F2", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "F2.b0", "volume": 64980}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "hole",
    "placement": {"type": "face", "body": "F2.b0", "face": "F2:side(c1[c4,c2])", "points": [[9.5, 9.5, 10]]},
    "diameter": 4.2, "extent": {"type": "through_all"}, "thread": {"designation": "M5x0.8", "class": "6H"}}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "F3", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "F2.b0"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "rectangular_pattern",
    "objects": {"type": "features", "features": ["F3"]},
    "direction1": {"axis": {"type": "origin", "axis": "z"}, "quantity": 6, "distance": 32},
    "distance_type": "spacing"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "F4", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "F2.b0"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "hole",
    "placement": {"type": "face", "body": "F2.b0", "face": "F2:side(c4[c3,c1])", "points": [[9.5, 9.5, 26]]},
    "diameter": 4.2, "extent": {"type": "through_all"}, "thread": {"designation": "M5x0.8", "class": "6H"}}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "F5", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "F2.b0"}},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "rectangular_pattern",
    "objects": {"type": "features", "features": ["F5"]},
    "direction1": {"axis": {"type": "origin", "axis": "z"}, "quantity": 5, "distance": 32},
    "distance_type": "spacing"}},
  {"expect": {"feature": "F6", "status": "ok", "bodies": 1, "body": "F2.b0"}},
  {"cmd": "add_drawing", "size": "A3"},
